    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get the physics part, but it almost sounds like it's alive or something lol. like it's almost a vocal thing. is there any other engine part that makes a weird noise like that, or is the turbo pretty unique with that kind of \"howling\" sound?",
      "source": "evaluator"
